---- MODULE subexpressions ----
EXTENDS Naturals

Target(x) == LET d == x + 1 IN lab :: \A y \in {d} : y = x + 1

Apply2(F(_, _), a, b) == F(a, b)
Use1 == Target(1)!lab!1
Use2 == Target(1)!lab!(2)
Use3 == Apply2(Target!lab!@, 1, 2)
Use4 == Target(1)!:!d!<<
Use5 == Target(1)!:!d!>>

---- MODULE Ops ----
a ++ b == a + b
a !! b == a + b
-. a == 0 - a
a^+ == a + 1
====

I == INSTANCE Ops
UseOps == I!++(1, 2) + I! !!(1, 2) + I!-.(1) + I!^+(1)
====
